Package: turtleDBF
Title: Read dBASE and Visual FoxPro DBF Files
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-06-10
Authors@R: 
    person(given = c("Andrew", "P."),
           family = "Colefax",
           email = "andrew.colefax@des.qld.gov.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads DBF files used by the Queensland turtle database, including
    dBASE III-compatible, dBASE Level 7 and Visual FoxPro layouts. Converts
    text encodings and returns the records as typed R data frames.
